  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Before, you only needed to choose an INSTANCE TYPE (like Public or Friends+) and a REGION (like USW or JP). But since version 2025.1.3, you also have to configure INSTANCE SETTINGS (e.g., Allow Emojis, Allow Stickers), which means more button presses when creating an instance. This extra step seems unnecessary and cumbersome.\n\nI suspect that most users rarely change INSTANCE SETTINGS or even the REGION each time they create an instance. So, I suggest that if a user wants to change these settings, they should go to a different pop-up window. If they don't want to change the default settings, they can just select the INSTANCE TYPE and click CREATE INSTANCE.",
